<title>USA: Woolworth to sell Silk &amp; Satin chain.</title>
<headline>Woolworth to sell Silk &amp; Satin chain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolworth Corp said on Tuesday that it planned to sell its Canadian-based, 42-store Silk &amp; Satin lingerie chain to the La Senza Inc unit of Suzy Shier Ltd for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The transaction, which is subject to the negotiation and signing of definitive agreement, was expected to be completed by mid-October, the company said.</p>
<p>Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Roger Farah said the planned sale was part of the company's plan to dispose of non-strategic businesses.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
